extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 15: Spirit West printed 44-47, read from the text layer; printed 45 is a full-page plate (checked on a render) and the entry runs from printed 44 straight to 46. No hit point or S.D.C. formula is printed, so compose.js supplies both (3D6 S.D.C. as a man of arms). Three of the six realms are chosen, as a choose-3 over six abilities. Stored as bonuses: the Earth Realm''s +2D6 P.S. and the Animal Realm''s hunter-sense combat and horror-factor bonuses. NOT stored, and in the realm text instead: the +1D6 supernatural P.E. that BOTH the Earth and Plant realms grant, because the book says two such bonuses do not combine and a bonus on each ability would add twice for a character taking both; and every conversion of S.D.C. and hit points into M.D.C., which no field expresses. The 1D4x10 M.D.C. prints as !D4xlO and P.P.E. as 2D4xlO, the digit substitution of BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT F53, read as 1D4x10 and 2D4x10; the trade goods read as 3D6x100. The major starting fetish is any one; the Medicine Bundle is left out of that list because printed 89 describes it as a tribe''s collection that is never divided or given away. The legendary fetish is typically a spirit bow, and the Spirit Weapon Fetish row covers every weapon form. The book says secondary skills are chosen at levels 3, 6 and 9 and names none at level 1, so none are granted at creation. English is a Language: Other pick at 98% because the catalog holds no English row. Equipment with no Rifts row stays in the body."
